  "prefLabel": "Phy 404.01 The Nature of Conditionally Reinstated Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 404.01 The Nature of Conditionally Reinstated Licenses. Conditionally reinstated licenses shall:\n\n(a) Remain valid for no more than 26 weeks unless their validity is extended pursuant to Phy 404.08 or Phy 404.09; and\n\n(b) Limit the practice of a physical therapist or physical therapist assistant to the supervised practice described in Phy 404.04.\n\nSource. #9431, eff 3-19-09; ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/phy400.html"
